<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-SWEDEN AND SWITZERLAND LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDEN AND SWITZERLAND LEVEL 1-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>LULEA, Sweden 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden and Switzerland were</p>
<p>level 1-1 after the opening singles in their Davis Cup world</p>
<p>group first round tie on Friday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Magnus Larsson (Sweden) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3) 3-6 6-4 4-6 13-11</p>
<p>Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Lorenzo Manta (Switzerland)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4) 7-6 (11-9) 6-2</p>
</text>
